A sized decorator layer marked repeat-x or repeat-y tiles its paint box along that axis only (CSS background-repeat:
repeat-x, repeat-y): one tile at the placed layer along the other axis, the paint area's clip mask cutting what falls
outside it, as patch 0059 tiles both axes for repeat.

